            },
            "description": "The <code>DeleteWorkerBlock</code> operation allows you to reinstate a blocked Worker to work on your HITs. This operation reverses the effects of the CreateWorkerBlock operation. You need the Worker ID to use this operation. If the Worker ID is missing or invalid, this operation fails and returns the message \u201cWorkerId is invalid.\u201d If the specified Worker is not blocked, this operation returns successfully."
